<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Tongkah stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Tongkah stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Tongkah Holdings Bhd stock was suspended on Monday pending a news announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at Tongkah, a diversified company, could not be reached for comment. Shares of the company last rose 14 cents to 4.34 ringgit prior to the suspension.</p>
<p>Tongkah's businesses include a brokerage firm, an interest in an Internet service provider, hospitals and a seismic data processing company.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
